set/parking-offences)\n* [Parking Permits, Meters and Rates](https://opendata.transport.nsw.gov.au/dataset/parking-permits-meters-and-rates)\n* [Loading Zones Kerbside](https://opendata.transport.nsw.gov.au/dataset/loading-zones-kerbside)\n* [Off-street Parking](https://opendata.transport.nsw.gov.au/dataset/off-street-parking)\n* [Car Share Bays](https://opendata.transport.nsw.gov.au/dataset/car-share-bays)\n\n\n", "num_resources": 0, "num_tags": 17, "organization": {"id": "83ac2e16-3767-445a-ac37-98d7c152e8a8", "name": "transport-for-nsw", "title": "Transport for NSW", "type": "organization", "description": "[Transport for NSW](http://www.transport.nsw.gov.au/) is the integrated transport authority in NSW, responsible for improving the customer experience, planning, program administration, policy, regulation, procuring transport services, infrastructure and freight. ", "image_url": "https://data.nsw.gov.au/data/images/TfNSW.png", "created": "2013-05-26T22:11:35.695267", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "83ac2e16-3767-445a-ac37-98d7c152e8a8", "private": false, "state": "active", "title": "Parking and Council Data", "type": "dataset", "unpublished": "false", "url": null, "version": null, "extras": [{"key": "harvest_portal", "value": "Transport"}, {"key": "harvest_url", "value": "https://opendata.transport.nsw.gov.au/dataset/parking-and-council-data"}], "tags": [{"display_name": "City of Sydney", "id": "20364c5c-01a0-43fd-a06f-431242afd720", "name": "City of Sydney", "state": "active", "vocabulary_id": null}, {"display_name": "car", "id": "8f1eb6fb-503d-4e2e-b1e0-6a0738048296", "name": "car", "state": "active", "vocabulary_id": null}, {"display_name": "car park", "id": "7611aad1-8663-4a23-95d4-d2897522405b", "name": "car park", "state": "active", "vocabulary_id": null}, {"display_name": "car space", "id": "9323ddb1-09ec-49fd-9858-aac7f05bd6e6", "name": "car space", "state": "active", "vocabulary_id": null}, {"dis